sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CM as Cutover Manager
    participant FU as FU DWH / Sources
    participant RB as RB DWH / Sources
    participant MDM as MDM / Reference
    participant TDWH as Target DWH
    participant DQ as DQ / Reconciliation
    participant BOARD as Go-No-Go Board
    participant BI as Unified BI / Reporting
    participant REG as Regulatory Export

    CM->>FU: Freeze ETL/report configuration
    CM->>RB: Freeze ETL/report configuration
    CM->>TDWH: Create restore point and pin release

    FU->>TDWH: Final delta + EOD manifest
    RB->>TDWH: Final delta + EOD manifest
    MDM->>TDWH: Golden dimensions + mapping snapshot

    TDWH->>TDWH: Load staging, dimensions and facts
    TDWH->>DQ: Counts, sums, hashes, entries and balances
    DQ->>FU: Compare source controls
    DQ->>RB: Compare source controls
    DQ->>BOARD: Reconciliation pack and exceptions

    alt All mandatory gates passed
        BOARD->>CM: GO
        CM->>BI: Switch datasource, schedules and subscriptions
        BI->>BI: Role-based smoke tests
        CM->>REG: Enable certified target export
        CM->>FU: Keep warm/read-only during fallback window
        CM->>RB: Keep warm/read-only during fallback window
        Note over TDWH,BI: Hypercare, daily Finance sign-off and SLO monitoring
    else Any abort criterion met
        BOARD->>CM: NO-GO / FALLBACK
        CM->>BI: Restore legacy datasource and schedules
        CM->>REG: Keep last approved legacy export route
        FU->>FU: Catch up legacy reporting
        RB->>RB: Catch up legacy reporting
        CM->>TDWH: Preserve snapshot and logs for RCA
        Note over CM,TDWH: New cutover only after fix and full rehearsal
    end
